{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"d2d0580e06c55b9e400ab219f7145534e6a1f88cc8ea7d8b90ad9f9171320d26","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["扫罗逝世"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["非利士人与以色列人争战，以色列人在非利士人面前逃跑，在基利波山有被杀仆倒的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["非利士人紧追扫罗和他儿子们，就杀了扫罗的儿子约拿单、亚比拿达、麦基舒亚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["势派甚大，扫罗被弓箭手追上，射伤甚重，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就吩咐拿他兵器的人说：「你拔出刀来，将我刺死，免得那些未受割礼的人来凌辱我。」但拿兵器的人甚惧怕，不肯刺他；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["扫罗就自己伏在刀上死了。拿兵器的人见扫罗已死，也伏在刀上死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["这样，扫罗和他三个儿子，并他的全家都一同死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["住平原的以色列众人见以色列军兵逃跑，扫罗和他儿子都死了，也就弃城逃跑，非利士人便来住在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["次日，非利士人来剥那被杀之人的衣服，看见扫罗和他儿子仆倒在基利波山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["就剥了他的军装，割下他的首级，打发人到",{"noteId":10},"非利士地的四境报信与他们的偶像和众民，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又将扫罗的军装放在他们神的庙里，将他的首级钉在大衮庙中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["基列·雅比人听见非利士人向扫罗所行的一切事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们中间所有的勇士就起身前去，将扫罗和他儿子的尸身送到雅比，将他们的尸骨葬在雅比的橡树下，就禁食七日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["这样，扫罗死了。因为他干犯耶和华，没有遵守耶和华的命；又因他求问交鬼的妇人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["没有求问耶和华，所以耶和华使他被杀，把国归于耶西的儿子大卫。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"-","text":"到：或译送到","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}